{
 "_about": "Seed of the helicopter-kit database for the Express wizard (Malcolm 2026-09-05: pick your helicopter from an alphabetical list → size class, gear ratio, blade length come for free). One entry per kit, discontinued kits included (people still fly them). Gear ratio = main gear teeth / pinion teeth; kits ship one pinion and offer others, so we store the stock pinion + options and the wizard asks 'which pinion?' only when the kit has options. Motor poles belong to the MOTOR, not the kit: stored only for kits sold with a fixed motor. verified=false until read from the maker's manual/spec page. Sources listed per entry.",
